{"senses": [{"examples": [{"text": "обы́скивать дом за до́мом", "bold_text_offsets": [[12, 15], [19, 25]], "roman": "obýskivatʹ dom za dómom", "bold_roman_offsets": [[11, 14], [18, 23]], "translation": "to search house by house", "english": "to search house by house", "bold_translation_offsets": [[10, 15], [19, 24]], "type": "example"}, {"text": "кварти́рный дом", "bold_text_offsets": [[12, 15]], "roman": "kvartírnyj dom", "bold_roman_offsets": [[11, 14]], "translation": "apartment building; block of flats", "english": "apartment building; block of flats", "bold_translation_offsets": [[10, 18], [20, 25]], "type": "example"}, {"text": "Сде́лав оди́н и́ли два поворо́та, геро́й наш очути́лся наконе́ц пе́ред са́мым до́мом, кото́рый показа́лся тепе́рь ещё печа́льнее.", "ref": "1842, Николай Гоголь [Nikolai Gogol], “Том I, Глава VI”, in Мёртвые души; English translation from Constance Garnett, transl., Dead Souls—A Poem, London: Chatto & Windus, 1922:", "english": "After turning round two or three corners, our hero found himself at last in front of the house, which looked even gloomier at close quarters.", "roman": "Sdélav odín íli dva povoróta, gerój naš očutílsja nakonéc péred sámym dómom, kotóryj pokazálsja tepérʹ ješčó pečálʹneje.", "type": "quotation", "translation": "After turning round two or three corners, our hero found himself at last in front of the house, which looked even gloomier at close quarters.", "bold_text_offsets": [[78, 84]], "bold_translation_offsets": [[89, 94]]}, {"text": "Дом име́л тот немно́го неве́рный вид, како́й быва́ет, когда́ там, внутри́, спят лю́ди.", "ref": "1930, Нина Берберова [Nina Berberova], chapter III, in Последние и первые, Paris: Jacques Povolozky & Cie; English translation from Marian Schwartz, transl., The Last and the First, London: Pushkin Press, 2021:", "english": "The house had that slightly uncertain look that can happen when there are people sleeping inside.", "roman": "Dom imél tot nemnógo nevérnyj vid, kakój byvájet, kogdá tam, vnutrí, spjat ljúdi.", "type": "quotation", "translation": "The house had that slightly uncertain look that can happen when there are people sleeping inside.", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 3]], "bold_translation_offsets": [[4, 9]]}], "links": [["house", "house"], ["building", "building"]], "synonyms": [{"word": "зда́ние"}], "categories": ["Russian terms with quotations", "Russian terms with usage examples"], "glosses": ["house, building (a residential building)"], "tags": ["inanimate", "masculine"]}, {"examples": [{"text": "изда́тельский дом", "bold_text_offsets": [[14, 17]], "roman": "izdátelʹskij dom", "bold_roman_offsets": [[13, 16]], "translation": "publishing house", "english": "publishing house", "bold_translation_offsets": [[11, 16]], "type": "example"}, {"text": "сумасше́дший дом / дурдо́м", "bold_text_offsets": [[13, 16], [22, 26]], "roman": "sumasšédšij dom / durdóm", "bold_roman_offsets": [[12, 15], [21, 24]], "translation": "insane asylum; madhouse", "english": "insane asylum; madhouse", "bold_translation_offsets": [[7, 13], [18, 23]], "type": "example"}, {"text": "дом о́тдыха", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 3]], "roman": "dom ótdyxa", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 3]], "translation": "holiday resort", "english": "holiday resort", "bold_translation_offsets": [[8, 14]], "type": "example"}, {"text": "дом престаре́лых", "bold_text_offsets": [[0, 3]], "roman": "dom prestarélyx", "bold_roman_offsets": [[0, 3]], "translation": "retirement home", "english": "retirement home", "bold_translation_offsets": [[11, 15]], "type": "example"}], "links": [["house", "house"], ["home", "home"]], "glosses": ["house, home (as part of a name of an establishment)"], "categories": ["Russian terms with usage examples"], "tags": ["inanimate", "masculine"]}, {"examples": [{"text": "Моско́вское шоссе́, дом 123, ко́рпус 2, кварти́ра 10", "bold_text_offsets": [[20, 23]], "roman": "Moskóvskoje šossé, dom 123, kórpus 2, kvartíra 10", "bold_roman_offsets": [[19, 22]], "translation": "123